<title>GERMANY: Vereinsbank says lowers Bayer to neutral.</title>
<headline>Vereinsbank says lowers Bayer to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank Research said on Tuesday it had lowered its rating on German chemicals group Bayer to &quot;market neutral&quot; from &quot;buy&quot;.</p>
<p>The research unit also said it had upped its recommendation for Bankgesellschaft Berlin to market neutral from below-average.</p>
</text>
